  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Harjeet Kaur vs State Of Punjab And Others on 9 December, 2024 Author: Mahabir Singh Sindhu Bench: Mahabir Singh Sindhu Neutral Citation No:=2024:PHHC:163569 Cwp No.32466-2024 1 In The High Court Of Punjab & Haryana At Chandigarh 114 Cwp No.32466-2024 (O&M) Date of Decision: 09.12.2024 Harjeet Kaur .....Petitioner Versus State of Punjab and others .....Respondents Coram: Hon'Ble Mr. Justice Mahabir Singh Sindhu Present: Mr. Harbir Sandhu, Advocate for the petitioner. ** ** Mahabir Singh Sindhu, J. Present writ petition has been filed under Article 226 of the Constitution for issuance of a writ in the nature of Mandamus inter alia for directing respondent No.3-The Transport Commissioner-Cum-Appellate Authority, Punjab to expeditiously decide appeal No.001 of 2024 under Punjab Motor Vehicle Act, 1924 and further directing the respondent No.2- The State Transport Appellate Tribunal, Chandigarh to expeditiously decide revision petition No.1 of 2024 under Section 90 of the Motor Vehicle Act, 1988. 2. This Court, on 02.12.2024, passed the following order:- Harjeet Kaur vs State Of Punjab And Others on 9 December, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/71497224/ 1",
